SimulationType                MonteCarlo
NumberOfCycles                200000
NumberOfInitializationCycles  200000
PrintEvery                    5000
RestartFile                   no

Forcefield                    GenericMOFs
CutOffVDW                     12.0
ChargeMethod                  Ewald
EwaldPrecision                1e-6
CutOffChargeCharge            12.0
OmitAdsorbateAdsorbateCoulombInteractions no
OmitAdsorbateAdsorbateVDWInteractions no

Framework                     0
FrameworkName                 COF-999-NH2-cp2k-Charges_2
UseChargesFromCIFFile         yes
RemoveAtomNumberCodeFromLabel yes
UnitCells                     1 1 7
HeliumVoidFraction            0.625
ExternalTemperature           77.0
ExternalPressure              21276.288

Component 0 MoleculeName              N2
            StartingBead              1
            MoleculeDefinition        ExampleDefinitions
            IdealGasRosenbluthWeight  1.0
            FugacityCoefficient       1.0
            TranslationProbability    1.0
            RotationProbability       1.0
            ReinsertionProbability    1.0
            SwapProbability           1.0
            CreateNumberOfMolecules   0
